{
  "book": "3JN",
  "chapter": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "1",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.1",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "The elder, To Gaius the beloved, whom I love in truth.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "2",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.2",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, concerning all things I pray you to prosper and to be in good health, just as your soul prospers.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "3",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.3",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "For I rejoiced exceedingly [on] the brothers' coming and testifying of your truth, just as you are walking in truth.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "4",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.4",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "I have no greater joy than these things, that I should hear of my children walking in the truth.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "5",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.5",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, you are doing faithfully whatever you might work for the brothers, and they are strangers,",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "6",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.6",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "who testified of your love before the church, whom you will do well having sent forward worthily of God.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.6"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "7",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.7",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "For they went out on behalf of the Name, receiving nothing from the Gentiles.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.7"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "8",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.8",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore we ought to support such, so that we may be fellow workers in the truth.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "9",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.9",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "I did write something to the church; but the one loving to be first among them, Diotrephes, does not welcome us.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.9"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "10",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.10",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Because of this, if I should come, I will bring to remembrance his works that he is doing, prattling against us with evil words; and not being satisfied with these, neither does he welcome the brothers himself, and he forbids those intending, and he casts [them] out of the church.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "11",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.11",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, do not imitate what [is] evil, but what [is] good. The one doing good is of God; the one doing evil has not seen God.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "12",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.12",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Testimony has been given to Demetrius by all, and by the truth itself; and we also testify, and you know that our testimony is true.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.12"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "13",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.13",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "I had many things to write to you, but I do not want to write to you with ink and pen;",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.13"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "verse",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "14",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.14",
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.14",
            "3JN.1.15"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.14"
        },
        {
          "text": "but I hope to see you soon, and we will speak mouth to mouth. Peace to you. The friends greet you. Greet the friends by name.",
          "anchor": "3JN.1.14",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "3JN.1.14",
            "3JN.1.15"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "3JN.1.14"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
